                <p>But if you do this, then you start to accept all of yourself,you&rsquo;ll find the resources to make the changes that you feel that you need to make so that you can accept yourself wholly and then with that acceptance, you start to grow, and steer your life to one that you have only ever imagined before.&nbsp;</p>
